<title>USA: U.S. Stockpile sells surplus manganese ore.</title>
<headline>U.S. Stockpile sells surplus manganese ore.</headline>
<dateline>WASHINGTON 1996-11-27</dateline>
<text>
<p>The U.S. Defense National Stockpile Center said Wednesday it sold 1,000,500 pounds of electrolytic manganese ore to Elkem Metals of Marietta, Ohio, in a long-term contract for an approximate current market value of $922,000.</p>
